    {
      "id": "claim_6aa43b733ef14199be3a02b2c5b3666c",
      "statement": "Helpdesk's runtime safety gate is structural inside the workflow: `build_helpdesk_workflow` builds the `triage -> retrieve -> resolve -> escalate` chain, `EscalationExecutor` pauses with `ctx.request_info(...)` when resolve emits a `TICKET:` result, and the ticket is created only in the response handler after the approval decision is interpreted and authorized.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/backend/app/modules/helpdesk/internal/escalation.py#L101-L163",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d01b71d82c39a5c9db41e3dcedafc9748b8eda3427c2dc77b61c000dba8cd64f:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/backend/app/modules/helpdesk/internal/escalation.py#L69-L99",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2b27b586f932f4997e3a2bbb4e91c85c7e3b6f7326f4f87b70e6ee4828539de5:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/backend/app/modules/helpdesk/internal/graph.py#L82-L100",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a44b1f570b58c668b7c7e8e0d98ffd309933b3d1019d14d89cdee300d6f6ce32:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9213a544577b414dab23ca1bccf128ab",
      "statement": "Helpdesk approval parsing is fail-closed: the response handler accepts both legacy booleans and decision objects, but `_read_answer()` only recognizes `approve`, `edit`, or `reject` and converts anything malformed or unrecognized into `reject`, so a bad payload cannot be the reason a ticket opens.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/backend/app/modules/helpdesk/internal/escalation.py#L166-L190",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ac90037d56687a6d1f76b745db870895f123fbc7f59ca24f2da42639008eefb8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5da5ac5494924d22b0ba6a17178e22f6",
      "statement": "The mounted helpdesk endpoint uses a per-request workflow factory so each run binds the current request's credential, memory scope, conversation history, and optionally grounded retrieval with the current user and domain spec rather than a boot-time shared workflow object.",
