      "id": "claim_79206a648c0e421295e42905e53641ca",
      "statement": "`TicketApproval` handles Agent Framework approval flows by subscribing directly to the agent event stream for `request_info` custom events, discriminating between helpdesk ticket approvals and platform tool approvals, and resuming the paused run with `agent.runAgent({ resume: [{ interruptId, status: \"resolved\", payload }] })`.",
