      "id": "claim_bb81a176e2e44f35a7617afbc6553589",
      "statement": "Platform is a per-request tool-driven agent: the registry mounts `platform_agent_proxy`, which rebuilds the platform agent on each run so the tool set reflects the current caller, and `build_platform_agent()` composes the agent from `PLATFORM_INSTRUCTIONS`, `build_mcp_tools()`, and a `ToolApprovalMiddleware` subclass that records decisions while leaving approval state management to the framework.",
      "evidence": [
        {
