      "id": "claim_dbedd594414e4f8b8bece157758dd798",
      "statement": "The platform discovery auth test covers the late-auth invariant end to end: it verifies that public discovery sends no auth header provider, connection-backed discovery resolves the tenant-local connection reference and only brokers the approved origin once per session, incompatible or missing connections fail before discovery executes, and OBO discovery derives its audience from the registry allowlist.",
